@Store.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5278

### Create order
POST {{Store.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders

### List orders
GET {{Store.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders

### Get order
GET {{Store.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

